06784#issuecomment-4218984062","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106784","id":4218984062,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77eJZ-","user":{"login":"Benjamin-Dobell","id":482276,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ4MjI3Ng==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/482276?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell","html_url":"https://github.com/Benjamin-Dobell","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Benjamin-Dobell/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-10T00:49:33Z","updated_at":"2026-04-10T00:49:33Z","body":"@shiena Thanks for making those changes. I'd made some similar changes locally but adopted yours about 24 hours ago. Working great 🙏","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4218984062/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4232404891","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106784#issuecomment-4232404891","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106784","id":4232404891,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc78RV-b","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-12T18:35:59Z","updated_at":"2026-04-12T18:35:59Z","body":"A note on the camera frame capture strategy. Browser support for the APIs we'd like to use for pulling pixels out of a `getUserMedia()` stream is uneven, so this PR implements several capture paths and picks the best one available at runtime.\r\n\r\nIn order of preference:\r\n\r\n1. **WebCodecs in a Worker** — `MediaStreamTrackProcessor` produces `VideoFrame`s, which are transferred to a dedicated Worker that extracts RGBA pixels via `VideoFrame.copyTo()`. No canvas, no main-thread pixel work. Used on modern Chromium.\r\n\r\n2. **Canvas 2D in a Worker** — `createImageBitmap()` on the `<video>` element produces a transferable bitmap; the Worker draws it to an `OffscreenCanvas` and reads pixels with `getImageData()`. Used when Workers are available but WebCodecs isn't (e.g. current Firefox).\r\n\r\n3. **WebCodecs on the main thread** — same `VideoFrame.copyTo()` pipeline as (1), but without offloading. Used when WebCodecs exists but Workers / `OffscreenCanvas` / `createImageBitmap` don't.\r\n\r\n4. **Canvas 2D on the main thread** — classic `drawImage(video)` + `getImageData()` driven by `requestAnimationFrame`. Last resort for browsers that lack both of the above (e.g. Safari without WebCodecs).\r\n\r\nThe tier is chosen once by feature detection when the stream starts. On top of that, each tier also falls back to a lower tier at runtime if its API unexpectedly throws (e.g. `VideoFrame.copyTo()` can fail even when the API is present), so a misdetected environment degrades gracefully instead of breaking the feed.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4232404891/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4765753302","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106784#issuecomment-4765753302","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106784","id":4765753302,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHA-f1g","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-22T07:06:35Z","updated_at":"2026-06-22T07:06:35Z","body":"Updated the Web CameraFeed implementation:\r\n\r\n- Uses WebCodecs + MediaStreamTrackProcessor to read camera frames into CameraFeed textures, with Canvas2D as the fallback path.\r\n- Keeps the initial format list empty until the camera is activated, since browsers may not expose reliable per-device formats before opening the stream.\r\n- Updates CameraFeed formats from the actual stream settings after activation, so the UI reflects the real width, height, and frame rate reported by the browser.\r\n- Removes problematic preset resolutions from the Web format candidates where browser-reported behavior is misleading or unreliable.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4765753302/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4780341719","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106784#issuecomment-4780341719","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106784","id":4780341719,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHO451w","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T14:36:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T14:36:47Z","body":"Updated the Web CameraFeed implementation:\r\n\r\n- Adds I420/I420A support that feeds the planar YUV frames straight into set_ycbcr_images by interleaving the U/V planes into a single Cb/Cr image and reusing the existing NV12 path, avoiding a per-frame RGBA color conversion (the I420A\r\nalpha plane is ignored).\r\n- Fixes NV12 decoding for odd capture sizes by rounding the chroma plane dimensions up, so streams whose width or height is odd are no longer mis-sized.\r\n- Requests real sensor modes with resizeMode: 'none' and reworks the resolution candidates (dropping monitor-centric presets, adding common 16:9/16:10/4:3 sizes, and sorting them by resolution), so delivered frames use native hardware\r\nmodes instead of cropped or scaled ones that often run at a lower frame rate.\r\n- Hardens camera switching on Android, where opening a camera right after stopping another can stall while the previous device is still being released: lengthens the teardown barrier, raises the getUserMedia timeout above libwebrtc's\r\nopen-retry budget so a busy device returns a clean AbortError, and retries on that transient error.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4780341719/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4783154272","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106784#issuecomment-4783154272","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106784","id":4783154272,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHRkkYA","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-23T20:25:17Z","updated_at":"2026-06-23T20:25:17Z","body":"There's one issue on Android Firefox that I haven't been able to work around. Camera switching is problematic because the device close happens asynchronously with no JS callback to signal completion. Opening a new camera too soon after closing the previous one can cause errors or, worse, leave the system in an unrecoverable stuck state. I added retry logic for the error case, but when it gets stuck, the only way out is closing or killing the browser tab.\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4783154272/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4797505222","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106784#issuecomment-4797505222","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106784","id":4797505222,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABHfQexg","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-25T08:55:59Z","updated_at":"2026-06-25T08:55:59Z","body":"Updated the Web CameraFeed implementation:\r\n  * Resolves the Android Firefox camera switching issue mentioned above by avoiding the open-before-close camera switch path. Switching now relies on stopping the current stream first, then starting the target stream after the browser\r\n  has had time to release the previous device.\r\n  * Keeps camera activation asynchronous and reports startup failures through `CameraFeed.activation_failed`, while serializing camera operations and canceling stale `getUserMedia()` requests so stop/start and format changes can recover\r\n  cleanly.\r\n  * Updated the demo to use one Web switching strategy: stop the current feed, wait briefly, start the target feed, retry transient startup failures up to 6 times, and fall back to the previous feed if the retry limit is reached.\r\n\r\nWith this approach, the Android Firefox stuck state is avoided in my testing, including switches involving telephoto/macro cameras.\r\nhttps://github.com/shiena/godot-camerafeed-demo/tree/feature/web-camera-switch-retry\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4797505222/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4833821398","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106784#issuecomment-4833821398","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106784","id":4833821398,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABIB5C1g","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-29T14:44:08Z","updated_at":"2026-06-29T14:44:08Z","body":"Thank you for the review. Applied all suggestions.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4833821398/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]